     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Steps in active and passive voice",
     "texto": [
      "To give direct instructions, use imperatives: **Registrer ordren først** («Register the order first»). The passive can focus attention on the procedure: **Temperaturen måles før varen pakkes** («The temperature is measured before the product is packed»). Alternate steps without hiding who is responsible."
     ],
